1
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:35,400
Given the current public climate,

2
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:37,920
I'm not suited to stay in the tournament.

3
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:39,960
But I won't quit.

4
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:42,000
After the tournament results are announced,

5
00:01:42,520 --> 00:01:43,520
I will choose to

6
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:44,640
challenge the champion team.

7
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,920
I don't want my own decision

8
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:48,120
to drag everyone down.

9
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,800
So if you leave the team now,

10
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:51,640
there's still time.

11
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:53,600
You can join other teams.

12
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,720
Even if you don't win the championship,

13
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:56,480
you'll still have a chance

14
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:57,960
to compete for second or third place.

15
00:01:58,440 --> 00:01:59,960
That is still a great honor.

16
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:02,720
But if you choose to stay with me,

17
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:05,600
there will be many unknown risks.

18
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:08,520
The champion team might not accept my challenge.

19
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:10,160
Even if they do,

20
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,880
I can't guarantee a 100% chance of winning.

21
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:14,760
If we lose,

22
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:17,560
then even the chance for second or third place

23
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:18,360
will be completely gone.

24
00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:19,680
Therefore,

25
00:02:20,440 --> 00:02:22,280
the decision is in your hands.

26
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,080
Captain,

27
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:26,640
there's nothing to think about.

28
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:27,640
I'm with you to the end.

29
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:28,560
Challenging the champion team...

30
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:30,040
Thrilling.

31
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:31,360
Then what's left to say?

32
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:32,760
Absolutely.

33
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:33,840
Backing you all the way.

34
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:34,960
Me too.

35
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:37,040
I won't settle for any other team.

36
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:39,040
Wherever the Captain is,

37
00:02:39,040 --> 00:02:39,880
that's where I'll be.

38
00:02:40,320 --> 00:02:40,720
Right.

39
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:41,800
Us too.

40
00:02:41,880 --> 00:02:42,400
Yeah.

41
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:44,000
No one left behind, never give up.

42
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:45,280
Exactly.

43
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:46,320
Well said.

44
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:48,480
Staff Officer Liang.

45
00:02:58,600 --> 00:02:59,240
Guo Zijian

46
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,360
You're just a gambler.

47
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:06,120
But according to my data analysis,

48
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:10,960
I've decided to put my chips on you.

49
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:14,160
Staff Officer Liang put it so well.

50
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:15,400
Give him a hand!

51
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:18,160
Good, good, good!

52
00:03:20,480 --> 00:03:22,160
Good, good, good.

53
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:23,120
Good.

54
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:40,080
Report.

55
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,040
Come in.

56
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:48,400
Have a seat.

57
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:49,400
Yes, Sir.

58
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,200
Sir,

59
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:53,880
these are the results of the competition.

60
00:03:53,880 --> 00:03:54,560
Please take a look.

61
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,000
They're out?

62
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:00,160
The 3rd Battalion of the Special Ops Brigade

63
00:04:01,320 --> 00:04:02,720
and the 2nd Battalion of the 396th Brigade

64
00:04:03,320 --> 00:04:04,400
are neck and neck.

65
00:04:05,200 --> 00:04:06,240
This is for the new drills.

66
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,520
But in the traditional confrontation drills,

67
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,480
Jiang Shengqiang

68
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:10,320
clearly wins out.

69
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:12,160
In terms of overall strength,

70
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:14,400
Jiang Shengqiang's team has the upper hand.

71
00:04:14,720 --> 00:04:15,440
That's right.

72
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:18,040
As for this Jiang Shengqiang,

73
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:20,440
I always feel he's lacking something.

74
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:23,240
Is it inspiration or insight?

75
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:25,360
Is it battlefield awareness?

76
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:27,240
Or a tactical commander's

77
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,360
on-the-spot decision-making?

78
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,200
It's hard to say.

79
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:32,080
What do you think?

80
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:33,640
I think

81
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,120
it might be a bit of everything.

82
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:37,560
But looking at the competition scores,

83
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,480
he is indeed in the lead.

84
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:40,800
Right.

85
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:42,880
Regarding these results,

86
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:44,960
what do the other Group Army leaders think?

87
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:47,560
The commanders' general idea is

88
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:49,120
it's best to take the top teams

89
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,360
and merge them into one.

90
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,400
To combine their strengths.

91
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:54,360
Understood.

92
00:04:55,640 --> 00:04:56,880
It's a compromise.

93
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:00,200
Report.

94
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:04,520
Reporting, Sir.

95
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:05,640
The Commander wants you in his office.

96
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:07,640
Understood.

97
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:13,120
Sir,

98
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:15,480
Seems like this has made quite a stir.

99
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,080
It's even alerted the higher-ups.

100
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:20,800
Let's go.

101
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:24,800
Shengqiang,

102
00:05:25,440 --> 00:05:27,120
I'm really happy for you.

103
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:29,240
Thank you, Sir.

104
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:33,240
Do you know why

105
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,720
I've always thought highly of you?

106
00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:39,840
Because compared to Guo Zijian,

107
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,120
you are more grounded

108
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:44,080
and hardworking.

109
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:45,800
You handle things

110
00:05:46,440 --> 00:05:47,160
steadily

111
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:48,800
and love to study.

112
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:50,760
Most importantly,

113
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:55,400
you have a strong grasp of the big picture.

114
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,960
Sir, you flatter me.

115
00:05:58,400 --> 00:05:59,240
Before,

116
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,360
I couldn't even keep my position

117
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,680
in the main assault battalion.

118
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:03,880
What does that matter?

119
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:06,160
As a commander,

120
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,280
you shouldn't fear failure.

121
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,480
What's valuable is

122
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:09,960
that you learn

123
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:11,680
from your failures

124
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:12,680
and keep growing.

125
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,360
I think

126
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:16,960
you have the potential for this.

127
00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:19,280
To be honest,

128
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:21,080
Guo Zijian

129
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:22,760
is talented

130
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,480
and very smart.

131
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:26,400
But

132
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:31,480
he has too many flaws.

133
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:33,320
He's always trying to win by surprise.

134
00:06:33,640 --> 00:06:34,440
Think about it.

135
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,640
If a war were to break out one day,

136
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:39,080
would I dare give him the commander's position?

137
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:41,320
His habit of walking a tightrope

138
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:43,880
could very well lead to the team's destruction.

139
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:47,040
But you are different.

140
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,920
You take steady steps

141
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,160
and advance cautiously.

142
00:06:50,880 --> 00:06:52,160
Giving the team to you

143
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,160
puts my mind at ease.

144
00:06:58,520 --> 00:06:59,640
Please rest assured, Sir.

145
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:02,000
I will not let you down.

146
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:03,280
Work hard.

147
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:04,440
I believe

148
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,640
the future belongs to you.

149
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:07,960
Yes, Sir.

150
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:15,520
Battalion Commander

151
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:17,280
The match results are out.

152
00:07:17,280 --> 00:07:18,040
As expected.

153
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:18,960
Jiang Shengqiang won.

154
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:20,040
So?

155
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:21,280
When do we deal with him?

156
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:24,080
No rush.

157
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:26,360
Let him celebrate for a bit first.

158
00:07:32,080 --> 00:07:33,040
Listen, Lao Liang.

159
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:36,160
This match of yours made quite a stir.

160
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,800
It even alerted the higher authorities.

161
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:39,520
Look at this.

162
00:07:40,640 --> 00:07:41,520
This is a good thing.

163
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:44,720
It was jointly facilitated by the Army command and the academy.

164
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:47,240
We are exactly in need of such a whetstone.

165
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:48,920
That's how I see it too.

166
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:51,840
This time, the higher authorities and relevant academies

167
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:53,280
jointly introduced this

168
00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:54,960
Simulated Blue Force Unit,

169
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,800
which is highly targeted.

170
00:07:57,520 --> 00:07:59,280
It allows the use and development

171
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,840
of our new-type combat forces

172
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:01,880
to undergo a

173
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:04,040
clash of mutual explorations.

174
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:05,400
But they said

175
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:06,560
within a single day,

176
00:08:06,760 --> 00:08:08,880
they want to challenge our top three winners.

177
00:08:10,200 --> 00:08:11,360
That's still a bit arrogant.

178
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:12,720
You need the right tools

179
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:14,360
for the job.

180
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:15,600
And these tools

181
00:08:16,520 --> 00:08:17,600
are tough enough.

182
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:19,640
We'll counter every move.

183
00:08:20,640 --> 00:08:22,200
Since they've come knocking on our door,

184
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:23,480
in this inevitable clash,

185
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,480
let's just accept the challenge.

186
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:25,760
Understood.

187
00:08:25,880 --> 00:08:27,040
I'll go arrange it right away.

188
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:29,200
The Army command is using its own referees.

189
00:08:29,960 --> 00:08:30,840
I will only accompany them

190
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:31,680
and won't speak.

191
00:08:34,799 --> 00:08:35,960
Since it's a confrontation,

192
00:08:36,760 --> 00:08:38,159
then let that kid Long Yuanshan

193
00:08:38,159 --> 00:08:39,039
tag along and watch.

194
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:40,240
He can't just hide and relax.

195
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,640
Hide and relax?

196
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,240
His nose is sharper than anyone's.

197
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:45,000
He already volunteered for battle.

198
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:43,000
I've heard great things about this training ground.

199
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:44,880
It really lives up to the hype.

200
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:46,200
No matter how good the ground is,

201
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:47,400
it still has to work in our favor.

202
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:49,120
Could you not be so cocky?

203
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:51,000
Do we even need to be?

204
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:51,960
Honestly, Captain,

205
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,240
I feel like us coming here

206
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,080
to go up against them

207
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,800
is practically an insult to ourselves.

208
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:57,640
It's all about exploration.

209
00:09:57,920 --> 00:09:58,600
Right?

210
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,920
Between us and them,

211
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:02,320
our operational models are completely different.

212
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:03,640
We're all just

213
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:05,960
trying to build our awareness of future warfare.

214
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:07,880
Since they've already formed a team,

215
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,520
they might've learned a few tricks.

216
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:11,320
Then we'll just shut down

217
00:10:11,400 --> 00:10:12,600
whatever tricks they've learned.

218
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:14,120
You're not wrong.

219
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,840
If we actually scored six to two,

220
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:18,240
I wouldn't even be happy.

221
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,040
If we don't win eight to zero,

222
00:10:20,040 --> 00:10:21,760
we can't prove that our model

223
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:22,760
is superior to theirs.

224
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:24,840
Such a waste of this training ground.

225
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:26,280
Yeah.

226
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:27,480
With such a great site,

227
00:10:27,640 --> 00:10:29,800
if we could just have a full-on Live-Force Confrontation,

228
00:10:29,800 --> 00:10:30,680
that would be awesome.

229
00:10:31,040 --> 00:10:32,040
Live-force?

230
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,360
I can't even bring myself to fight them in a simulation.

231
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:47,280
Captain Wu, right?

232
00:10:47,400 --> 00:10:47,800
Yes.

233
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:49,120
I'm Wu Dazhou.

234
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:51,000
I'm Guo Zijian, Captain of the Support Team.

235
00:10:51,280 --> 00:10:52,760
From now on, the Special Forces'

236
00:10:52,800 --> 00:10:54,200
logistics will be my responsibility.

237
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:55,080
Captain Guo.

238
00:10:55,680 --> 00:10:56,640
I appreciate the gesture,

239
00:10:56,920 --> 00:10:57,600
but we won't need it.

240
00:10:58,360 --> 00:10:59,440
Don't be so polite, Captain Wu.

241
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:00,960
Troops don't just fight,

242
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:02,080
they also need to eat and sleep.

243
00:11:02,560 --> 00:11:04,000
Tents, food...

244
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:05,000
We brought everything.

245
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:07,440
We've even picked out a spot.

246
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:08,480
Right here,

247
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:09,560
to set up camp.

248
00:11:10,920 --> 00:11:11,720
I see.

249
00:11:12,760 --> 00:11:14,360
The leaders of our training team

250
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:15,880
are waiting to welcome you all.

251
00:11:16,160 --> 00:11:17,080
Please don't.

252
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:19,040
We're here for a confrontation,

253
00:11:19,040 --> 00:11:19,880
which makes us opponents.

254
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:20,520
Right?

255
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:21,760
If we meet today,

256
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:23,480
we might hold back in the field.

257
00:11:24,920 --> 00:11:26,080
You're a straightforward man, Captain Wu.

258
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,600
Then I wish you

259
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:29,240
great success.

260
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:30,160
And I will pass your words

261
00:11:30,160 --> 00:11:31,160
on to our leaders.

262
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:32,320
Much appreciated, Captain Guo.

263
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:33,520
Alright, I won't bother you further.

264
00:11:33,520 --> 00:11:35,120
If you need anything, let me know.

265
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:36,000
I'm always available.

266
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:37,520
Here's my number.

267
00:11:38,160 --> 00:11:39,080
Alright, Captain Guo.

268
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:48,400
They absolutely refuse to meet us,

269
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:50,880
and even handle their own food and lodging.

270
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:53,240
What does that tell you?

271
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:55,640
They mean business.

272
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,720
The battle starts tomorrow.

273
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:00,640
No extra training tonight,

274
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:03,920
but you need to study your tactics.

275
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,160
Think about

276
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:08,000
the problems that might arise tomorrow.

277
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:09,440
Chief Xu.

278
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,440
Is it really a Gauntlet match?

279
00:12:11,640 --> 00:12:12,240
Yes.

280
00:12:12,400 --> 00:12:13,640
They came prepared.

281
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:15,560
They intend to take on three at once.

282
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:18,920
That's too arrogant.

283
00:12:21,160 --> 00:12:22,800
Whether it's just a tactical arrangement,

284
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:24,720
or they actually have the skills,

285
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:26,320
tomorrow's battle

286
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:27,520
will make it clear.

287
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:29,000
Jiang Shengqiang!

288
00:12:29,760 --> 00:12:30,400
Here!

289
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:31,880
Rest up and gather your strength.

290
00:12:32,280 --> 00:12:33,760
Tomorrow's main event

291
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:35,160
depends on you.

292
00:12:35,680 --> 00:12:36,240
Yes, sir!

293
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:38,320
I guarantee mission success!

294
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:40,080
I'm not just bragging.

295
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:41,360
If we were in this fight,

296
00:12:41,520 --> 00:12:43,560
we'd beat the crap out of Wu Dazhou.

297
00:12:44,400 --> 00:12:46,320
I've heard of this Wu Dazhou.

298
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:47,760
He's a ruthless guy.

299
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:48,880
He won't be that easy to deal with.

300
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:50,680
Yang Maolin, whose side are you on?

301
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:52,320
Addicted to being a traitor?

302
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,520
I'm not a traitor.

303
00:12:54,920 --> 00:12:55,600
Alright, alright.

304
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:57,120
What's the point of you two arguing?

305
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:58,200
The way I see it,

306
00:12:58,200 --> 00:12:59,360
it's not going to be our turn anyway.

307
00:13:01,280 --> 00:13:01,960
Captain,

308
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:03,480
say something.

309
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:05,480
Know your enemy and know yourself,

310
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:06,640
and you will never be defeated.

311
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:08,400
Let them warm up first.

312
00:13:08,560 --> 00:13:09,480
What's wrong with that?

313
00:13:09,880 --> 00:13:10,560
Does that mean

314
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:12,400
you've decided to challenge the champion team?

315
00:13:14,800 --> 00:13:15,600
For a challenge,

316
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:18,160
we naturally seek the strongest opponent

317
00:13:18,600 --> 00:13:20,320
to prove our true strength.

318
00:13:20,680 --> 00:13:21,880
This Wu Dazhou

319
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:22,920
came at the perfect time.

320
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:23,960
Captain,

321
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:26,440
are you implying

322
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:28,000
that Jiang Shengqiang will lose?

323
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:29,080
I didn't say that.

324
00:13:29,680 --> 00:13:31,040
We won't know until they fight.

325
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:32,760
As for this matter,

326
00:13:33,640 --> 00:13:35,000
just keep it between the three of you.

327
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:36,320
Don't go blabbing it outside.

328
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:37,160
Understood.

329
00:13:37,560 --> 00:13:39,320
We're aiming for a quiet start

330
00:13:39,920 --> 00:13:40,840
for a stunning finish.

331
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:55,560
Prepare to acquire target.

332
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:57,080
Report, target locked.

333
00:13:57,680 --> 00:13:58,880
Hit it with two missiles.

334
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:00,680
Two infrared-guided missiles.

335
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:01,480
Fire!

336
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:14,440
Sir.

337
00:14:14,760 --> 00:14:15,480
The food is here.

338
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:17,680
Got it.

339
00:14:20,640 --> 00:14:21,480
Brigade Commander Long.

340
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:22,360
Busy?

341
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:27,120
The Support Captain of the training team said

342
00:14:27,520 --> 00:14:29,240
the boxed lunches have been brought to the site.

343
00:14:30,760 --> 00:14:31,480
I have to say,

344
00:14:31,680 --> 00:14:33,760
this Support Captain is really sharp.

345
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:35,680
The food arrived at just the right time.

346
00:14:37,160 --> 00:14:37,960
This confrontation,

347
00:14:38,520 --> 00:14:40,200
although postponed to 1:00 PM,

348
00:14:41,280 --> 00:14:42,440
will end very soon.

349
00:14:43,640 --> 00:14:44,400
The confrontation is over.

350
00:14:44,520 --> 00:14:45,360
Blue Force wins!

351
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:46,200
The score is

352
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:47,040
seven to one.

353
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:52,680
These two simulated confrontations this morning

354
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:53,760
were so frustrating.

355
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:54,960
If it were us,

356
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:56,520
we'd kick their asses.

357
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:57,240
Shut up.

358
00:14:59,880 --> 00:15:00,520
How is it going?

359
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:02,840
I've pretty much figured it out.

360
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,400
Eat quickly.

361
00:15:04,800 --> 00:15:06,240
We have a tough battle this afternoon.

362
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,120
Captain Wu.

363
00:15:07,520 --> 00:15:08,160
Captain Guo.

364
00:15:08,400 --> 00:15:09,560
Knowing you guys

365
00:15:09,560 --> 00:15:10,360
didn't cook for lunch,

366
00:15:10,520 --> 00:15:11,920
we prepared a few good dishes for you.

367
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:12,760
Come, have a seat.

368
00:15:12,760 --> 00:15:13,800
You're too kind. Thanks for the trouble.

369
00:15:13,800 --> 00:15:14,600
No trouble at all.

370
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:15,480
Brothers, sit down.

371
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:17,760
Look how thoughtful they are.

372
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:19,920
Our spicy chicken is quite good.

373
00:15:19,920 --> 00:15:20,480
Give it a try.

374
00:15:22,520 --> 00:15:23,360
Your food

375
00:15:23,640 --> 00:15:25,000
looks really good.

376
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:26,640
If you enjoy the meal,

377
00:15:26,640 --> 00:15:27,920
that's the best compliment for us.

378
00:15:28,400 --> 00:15:29,640
This spicy chicken is fantastic.

379
00:15:33,400 --> 00:15:34,720
By the way, let me ask you,

380
00:15:35,400 --> 00:15:36,200
your

381
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:37,560
Champion Team,

382
00:15:37,840 --> 00:15:38,600
how good are they?

383
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:40,400
Look, just this morning,

384
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:42,040
we took out two teams.

385
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:43,680
If they're all at this level,

386
00:15:43,880 --> 00:15:44,880
we won't be eating here tonight.

387
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:48,320
I really can't answer that for you.

388
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:50,120
If you ask me how much cabbage costs a pound,

389
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:51,280
I might know.

390
00:15:51,760 --> 00:15:53,240
But our

391
00:15:53,760 --> 00:15:55,240
Champion Team is also pretty strong.

392
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:56,600
But I think

393
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:57,560
you guys will do fine.

394
00:15:58,560 --> 00:15:59,320
Smooth talker.

395
00:15:59,920 --> 00:16:00,680
Captain Guo,

396
00:16:01,760 --> 00:16:02,560
get back to your business.

397
00:16:02,560 --> 00:16:03,440
Okay, okay, okay.

398
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:05,200
Let's eat quickly, too.

399
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:06,720
We still need to set up the venue later.

400
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:11,600
We really should thank them.

401
00:16:11,880 --> 00:16:13,560
The brothers from the training team

402
00:16:13,920 --> 00:16:15,280
are still running around helping out.

403
00:16:15,520 --> 00:16:16,360
Thanks for your hard work.

404
00:16:17,680 --> 00:16:18,680
Remember,

405
00:16:19,560 --> 00:16:20,520
find a way

406
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:23,720
to learn from the lessons of the first two teams

407
00:16:24,760 --> 00:16:26,440
and figure out their tactical patterns.

408
00:16:27,400 --> 00:16:28,080
Jiang Shengqiang,

409
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:30,360
you must adapt to their changes.

410
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:32,320
Yes, Sir.

411
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:33,360
Salute!

412
00:16:38,040 --> 00:16:38,600
Move out!

413
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:54,080
I never expected

414
00:16:55,520 --> 00:16:57,000
our two strong teams

415
00:16:57,440 --> 00:16:58,600
compared to them

416
00:16:59,720 --> 00:17:01,160
would look like they're playing house.

417
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:04,119
It shows we aren't strong enough.

418
00:17:05,119 --> 00:17:06,599
If we hadn't fought this battle,

419
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:07,960
we wouldn't have known

420
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:09,400
that the gap between us is so huge.

421
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:18,240
Interesting, brothers.

422
00:17:18,520 --> 00:17:20,160
They beat us in the first clash right off the bat.

423
00:17:21,599 --> 00:17:23,520
Keep your eyes wide open.

424
00:17:24,040 --> 00:17:25,319
In the remaining clashes,

425
00:17:25,359 --> 00:17:26,400
we can't afford to lose a single one.

426
00:17:26,599 --> 00:17:27,440
Understood!

427
00:17:27,880 --> 00:17:29,080
Even though they won the first round,

428
00:17:29,760 --> 00:17:30,800
they pushed too hard.

429
00:17:31,600 --> 00:17:33,320
They exposed their strength too early.

430
00:17:34,040 --> 00:17:35,760
Their intentions are entirely obvious now.

431
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:38,280
You can't win a battle if you show your hand.

432
00:17:38,640 --> 00:17:41,240
Today, we must hand them a total defeat.

433
00:17:41,840 --> 00:17:43,200
Keep a close eye on their drones.

434
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:44,680
EW Team,

435
00:17:44,680 --> 00:17:46,440
avoid info-warfare entanglement with the Blue Force.

436
00:17:46,840 --> 00:17:47,840
EW Team, understood.

437
00:17:48,040 --> 00:17:49,440
Air Assault Fire, prepare.

438
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:50,960
Air Assault Fire, preparing.

439
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:55,200
Captain!

440
00:17:55,240 --> 00:17:56,200
Our drone fleet

441
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:57,240
was intercepted by both their laser

442
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:58,600
and jamming equipment.

443
00:17:58,680 --> 00:17:59,520
It has suffered heavy losses.

444
00:17:59,520 --> 00:18:00,600
They can no longer deploy.

445
00:18:01,960 --> 00:18:03,640
This battle is so frustrating.

446
00:18:04,120 --> 00:18:06,040
We can't even use our full strength.

447
00:18:06,600 --> 00:18:07,240
Orders!

448
00:18:07,560 --> 00:18:08,800
Once a target is spotted,

449
00:18:08,800 --> 00:18:10,440
concentrate long-range fire on it.

450
00:18:10,560 --> 00:18:11,160
Understood!

451
00:18:52,320 --> 00:18:53,320
Why did you come out?

452
00:18:55,040 --> 00:18:56,680
The comrades from the Army Training Bureau are here,

453
00:18:57,040 --> 00:18:58,520
why would I need to interfere?

454
00:18:59,120 --> 00:18:59,720
Professor.

455
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:02,480
I think our match against the Special Ops team this time

456
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:03,200
isn't fair.

457
00:19:04,040 --> 00:19:04,960
Why do you say that?

458
00:19:05,760 --> 00:19:07,680
Our exploration has just begun.

459
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:09,360
Personnel, equipment...

460
00:19:09,360 --> 00:19:10,160
we have absolutely nothing.

461
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:11,600
Let alone a proper organizational structure.

462
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:13,960
The frontline comrades who came here

463
00:19:14,040 --> 00:19:15,920
are competing for tomorrow.

464
00:19:16,360 --> 00:19:17,640
But tomorrow hasn't arrived yet.

465
00:19:18,440 --> 00:19:19,880
The Special Ops team is different.

466
00:19:20,040 --> 00:19:22,160
They are already a well-established team.

467
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:23,800
Their breaking-in period is long gone.

468
00:19:23,800 --> 00:19:24,960
From tactics and strategies

469
00:19:24,960 --> 00:19:26,480
to the use of their equipment,

470
00:19:27,040 --> 00:19:28,640
they already have a solid foundation.

471
00:19:29,120 --> 00:19:30,200
Under these conditions,

472
00:19:30,280 --> 00:19:31,240
for them to challenge us...

473
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:31,960
isn't that

474
00:19:32,280 --> 00:19:33,520
obviously bullying?

475
00:19:37,040 --> 00:19:38,480
But they're already here.

476
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:40,480
We can't exactly shut them out.

477
00:19:41,800 --> 00:19:43,080
So my point is,

478
00:19:43,360 --> 00:19:44,280
this is just the reality,

479
00:19:44,280 --> 00:19:45,680
and it doesn't mean we're inferior to them.

480
00:19:46,280 --> 00:19:47,320
Don't get upset, Professor.

481
00:19:51,560 --> 00:19:52,800
You can tell I'm upset?

482
00:19:53,840 --> 00:19:55,320
Then maybe I should use another word.

483
00:19:55,800 --> 00:19:56,520
You're disappointed.

484
00:19:58,120 --> 00:19:59,440
You cheeky girl.

485
00:20:01,320 --> 00:20:03,080
I originally thought that in this confrontation,

486
00:20:03,560 --> 00:20:04,240
at the very least,

487
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:05,480
we could hold out for three days.

488
00:20:06,120 --> 00:20:07,360
I didn't expect that in less than a day,

489
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:08,680
our competitors

490
00:20:08,680 --> 00:20:09,640
would all be wiped out.

491
00:20:14,040 --> 00:20:15,320
Don't get upset, Professor.

492
00:20:15,920 --> 00:20:17,560
It's not time for us to admit defeat yet.

493
00:20:20,200 --> 00:20:21,080
I hope so.

494
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:23,280
Let's hope Jiang Shengqiang and the others

495
00:20:24,400 --> 00:20:25,520
can pull one back.

496
00:20:28,040 --> 00:20:29,200
Do you think they still can?

497
00:20:29,680 --> 00:20:31,720
How can you boost their morale

498
00:20:31,720 --> 00:20:33,160
and dampen our own?

499
00:20:35,120 --> 00:20:36,480
If our spirit is truly strong,

500
00:20:37,320 --> 00:20:38,680
who could possibly dampen it?

501
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:47,920
Company Commander!

502
00:20:48,560 --> 00:20:49,480
Company Commander!

503
00:20:50,160 --> 00:20:50,720
Company Commander!

504
00:20:51,120 --> 00:20:52,080
What are you doing?

505
00:20:52,240 --> 00:20:53,200
Flailing about like that.

506
00:20:54,200 --> 00:20:54,920
What is it?

507
00:20:55,120 --> 00:20:55,960
It's all over.

508
00:20:56,800 --> 00:20:57,560
Battalion Commander Jiang lost.

509
00:20:58,560 --> 00:20:59,760
Is it our turn now?

510
00:20:59,760 --> 00:21:00,720
Our Battalion Commander ordered

511
00:21:00,920 --> 00:21:01,600
the First Battalion

512
00:21:01,600 --> 00:21:02,840
to enter combat readiness immediately

513
00:21:02,840 --> 00:21:03,720
and stand by for orders.

514
00:21:04,200 --> 00:21:04,840
Great!

515
00:21:05,120 --> 00:21:05,880
Signalman!

516
00:21:06,120 --> 00:21:07,560
Notify the company. Assemble immediately.

517
00:21:07,560 --> 00:21:08,120
Yes, sir!

518
00:21:10,040 --> 00:21:11,240
I've been dying for some action.

519
00:21:12,040 --> 00:21:12,920
Sirs.

520
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:15,160
Regarding our Special Ops team's visit,

521
00:21:15,960 --> 00:21:16,880
how should I put this...

522
00:21:19,080 --> 00:21:19,920
we are very disappointed.

523
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:21,800
Extremely disappointed.

524
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:24,160
We originally wanted to come here

525
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:25,800
to have a proper confrontation.

526
00:21:26,640 --> 00:21:28,840
We did not expect it to turn into

527
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:30,880
the strong bullying the weak.

528
00:21:32,240 --> 00:21:33,200
We have always heard

529
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:34,240
that the 8th Group Army

530
00:21:34,400 --> 00:21:36,200
is conducting new-type training.

531
00:21:36,760 --> 00:21:39,120
We always wanted to come learn and experience it.

532
00:21:39,560 --> 00:21:41,280
But after today's confrontation,

533
00:21:41,280 --> 00:21:42,080
I feel that

534
00:21:42,800 --> 00:21:44,240
we came a bit too early.

535
00:21:44,800 --> 00:21:46,480
Your new-type training

536
00:21:46,480 --> 00:21:48,320
is indeed not mature enough yet,

537
00:21:48,840 --> 00:21:51,080
and still needs more development.

538
00:21:52,080 --> 00:21:52,640
Sir,

539
00:21:53,360 --> 00:21:54,240
we are just

540
00:21:54,240 --> 00:21:55,480
pointing out the issues we saw.

541
00:21:55,760 --> 00:21:56,560
We mean no offense.

542
00:22:00,120 --> 00:22:01,320
You are the victors.

543
00:22:02,360 --> 00:22:03,520
You have the right to judge.

544
00:22:05,480 --> 00:22:06,400
Director Xu,

545
00:22:07,240 --> 00:22:08,840
I can understand how you feel.

546
00:22:09,120 --> 00:22:10,280
But the facts

547
00:22:10,520 --> 00:22:11,400
are the facts.

548
00:22:12,520 --> 00:22:13,720
Organizing this arena match

549
00:22:13,720 --> 00:22:14,680
is a good thing.

550
00:22:15,040 --> 00:22:15,960
But if

551
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:17,720
you let your top three

552
00:22:17,720 --> 00:22:19,680
form the new-type combat units,

553
00:22:20,520 --> 00:22:22,160
can you trust them on the battlefield?

554
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:27,600
Report!

555
00:22:29,040 --> 00:22:29,800
Sirs,

556
00:22:30,600 --> 00:22:31,680
Since ancient times,

557
00:22:31,680 --> 00:22:33,440
The victor is king, the loser is a bandit.

558
00:22:34,120 --> 00:22:35,240
As a defeated general,

559
00:22:35,560 --> 00:22:36,760
I have nothing to say.

560
00:22:37,360 --> 00:22:38,120
However,

561
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:40,280
I want to remind Captain Wu

562
00:22:40,880 --> 00:22:41,760
that I do not represent

563
00:22:41,760 --> 00:22:43,800
the true strength of new-type combat forces.

564
00:22:45,240 --> 00:22:46,640
The reason you won

565
00:22:46,760 --> 00:22:47,600
is because

566
00:22:47,800 --> 00:22:49,480
you haven't met a real opponent.

567
00:22:50,280 --> 00:22:51,240
Jiang Shengqiang,

568
00:22:52,040 --> 00:22:53,160
to be honest,

569
00:22:53,560 --> 00:22:54,440
a loss is a loss.

570
00:22:54,440 --> 00:22:56,000
Why bring up all this nonsense?

571
00:22:56,760 --> 00:22:57,760
Comrade Suo Jian'an,

572
00:22:57,760 --> 00:22:58,440
don't interrupt.

573
00:22:58,440 --> 00:22:59,160
Let him speak.

574
00:22:59,360 --> 00:22:59,880
Yes, sir.

575
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:02,880
Then I'll say it.

576
00:23:03,160 --> 00:23:05,280
If you're capable, challenge the training team.

577
00:23:05,640 --> 00:23:07,240
If the outcome is still the same,

578
00:23:07,240 --> 00:23:09,240
I, Jiang Shengqiang, will fully accept it.

579
00:23:10,040 --> 00:23:10,960
The training team?

580
00:23:11,440 --> 00:23:13,640
Aren't you the representative team for this training?

581
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:15,080
What other training team is there?

582
00:23:15,560 --> 00:23:16,440
The Support Captain,

583
00:23:16,560 --> 00:23:17,400
Guo Zijian.

584
00:23:20,680 --> 00:23:21,600
