It's a fake.

872
00:32:57,680 --> 00:32:58,040
Old Cui.

873
00:32:58,200 --> 00:32:59,000
Are you in yet?

874
00:32:59,080 --> 00:32:59,920
I've tapped in,

875
00:32:59,920 --> 00:33:00,760
but Red Force has an expert.

876
00:33:00,760 --> 00:33:01,720
The Trojan can't get through.

877
00:33:02,520 --> 00:33:03,200
Keep trying.

878
00:33:03,240 --> 00:33:03,640
Yes, sir.

879
00:33:03,800 --> 00:33:04,880
Tell Bobcat to fall back immediately.

880
00:33:04,880 --> 00:33:05,280
Yes, sir.

881
00:33:05,600 --> 00:33:06,280
Bobcat, Bobcat.

882
00:33:06,360 --> 00:33:07,880
Fall back immediately. Fall back immediately.

883
00:33:07,880 --> 00:33:08,440
Copy that.

884
00:33:08,840 --> 00:33:09,240
Fall back.

885
00:33:22,840 --> 00:33:24,880
Search them for anything useful.

886
00:33:24,960 --> 00:33:25,600
Take it all.

887
00:33:25,600 --> 00:33:26,240
Yes, sir.

888
00:33:30,000 --> 00:33:31,280
We guessed there'd be an ambush,

889
00:33:31,960 --> 00:33:32,840
but we didn't expect the ambush point

890
00:33:32,840 --> 00:33:33,920
to be so close to the decoy point.

891
00:33:36,080 --> 00:33:37,160
You just received orders

892
00:33:37,160 --> 00:33:38,360
to head back, right?

893
00:33:40,160 --> 00:33:41,680
Luhuitou is exactly what we wanted.

894
00:33:42,520 --> 00:33:44,480
Since you've already replied to your orders,

895
00:33:44,680 --> 00:33:45,960
you might as well just stay put.

896
00:33:46,520 --> 00:33:47,440
Once the battle is over,

897
00:33:47,600 --> 00:33:48,640
someone will come pick you up.

898
00:33:48,880 --> 00:33:50,000
That's a ruthless tactic.

899
00:33:50,360 --> 00:33:51,360
You don't even take prisoners.

900
00:33:51,520 --> 00:33:53,400
Know our squad leader's nickname?

901
00:33:53,600 --> 00:33:54,080
What?

902
00:33:54,280 --> 00:33:55,360
Ruthless and a man of few words.

903
00:33:55,360 --> 00:33:56,360
Meet the Honey Badger.

904
00:33:57,480 --> 00:33:58,360
You talk too much.

905
00:33:58,920 --> 00:34:00,560
Squad Leader Hong said so.

906
00:34:00,800 --> 00:34:01,560
Cut the crap.

907
00:34:02,720 --> 00:34:03,160
Move out.

908
00:34:03,360 --> 00:34:03,800
Yes, sir.

909
00:34:10,400 --> 00:34:11,199
Yang Maolin reporting.

910
00:34:11,199 --> 00:34:12,520
Six duck eggs have been taken care of.

911
00:34:12,520 --> 00:34:13,840
Tell Yang Maolin to proceed as planned.

912
00:34:13,840 --> 00:34:14,480
Yes, sir.

913
00:34:25,560 --> 00:34:26,040
Captain

914
00:34:26,040 --> 00:34:26,960
A Red Force detachment

915
00:34:26,960 --> 00:34:28,280
is massing toward the peak of Phoenix Cry Mountain.

916
00:34:28,520 --> 00:34:29,440
They're about to reach the summit.

917
00:34:29,600 --> 00:34:30,080
Should we engage?

918
00:34:32,040 --> 00:34:32,880
Let them pass.

919
00:34:33,199 --> 00:34:33,800
Yes, sir.

920
00:34:34,320 --> 00:34:34,840
Lin Yihu.

921
00:34:35,040 --> 00:34:35,440
Sir!

922
00:34:36,320 --> 00:34:37,080
Your recon squad

923
00:34:37,080 --> 00:34:39,400
is only responsible for securing the north slope pass.

924
00:34:39,600 --> 00:34:40,760
If you spot any stragglers on the way,

925
00:34:40,880 --> 00:34:41,520
take them out immediately.

926
00:34:41,520 --> 00:34:42,080
Yes, sir.

927
00:34:43,159 --> 00:34:44,600
If you spot the main Blue Force,

928
00:34:45,159 --> 00:34:46,040
send a signal immediately.

929
00:34:46,679 --> 00:34:47,199
Remember,

930
00:34:47,199 --> 00:34:48,480
to prevent the Blue Force from flanking,

931
00:34:48,480 --> 00:34:49,239
the north pass

932
00:34:49,239 --> 00:34:50,800
must remain in our hands at all times.

933
00:34:50,920 --> 00:34:51,800
Yes, sir. Understood.

934
00:34:52,679 --> 00:34:53,320
Let's go.

935
00:34:55,120 --> 00:34:56,120
In all directions from the summit,

936
00:34:56,280 --> 00:34:57,040
stay on high alert.

937
00:34:57,120 --> 00:34:57,760
Yes, sir.

938
00:35:04,200 --> 00:35:05,560
You really know the terrain well.

939
00:35:05,880 --> 00:35:07,440
Phoenix Cry Mountain is already in our hands.

940
00:35:07,880 --> 00:35:09,000
With this high ground,

941
00:35:09,840 --> 00:35:11,480
if the Blue Force wants to cross Phoenix Cry Mountain

942
00:35:11,480 --> 00:35:12,360
and reach Champion City,

943
00:35:13,560 --> 00:35:14,320
it will be difficult.

944
00:35:15,120 --> 00:35:16,080
If they cross the mountain,

945
00:35:16,520 --> 00:35:17,400
their path is blocked.

946
00:35:18,080 --> 00:35:19,440
If they detour via the mountain road,

947
00:35:19,800 --> 00:35:21,600
they risk being attacked from above.

948
00:35:22,600 --> 00:35:23,560
It's indeed difficult.

949
00:35:24,320 --> 00:35:24,920
Not necessarily.

950
00:35:26,680 --> 00:35:27,840
Logically, the Blue Force

951
00:35:27,840 --> 00:35:29,200
is closer to Phoenix Cry Mountain.

952
00:35:29,800 --> 00:35:30,880
Their delay in showing up

953
00:35:31,320 --> 00:35:32,520
probably means they have other plans.

954
00:35:32,760 --> 00:35:33,800
You're right, Sir.

955
00:35:34,040 --> 00:35:34,840
Furthermore,

956
00:35:35,000 --> 00:35:37,240
this isn't a traditional offensive and defensive battle.

957
00:35:40,680 --> 00:35:41,880
Speak of the devil.

958
00:35:42,440 --> 00:35:43,520
The Blue Force is here.

959
00:35:43,800 --> 00:35:44,720
Judging by their formation,

960
00:35:44,720 --> 00:35:46,560
Wu Dazhou is very confident.

961
00:35:54,480 --> 00:35:55,400
Good moves.

962
00:35:56,040 --> 00:35:56,720
What a pity.

963
00:35:59,640 --> 00:36:00,400
Squad Leader.

964
00:36:00,720 --> 00:36:01,920
It's a fierce fight!

965
00:36:02,360 --> 00:36:03,080
I think

966
00:36:03,640 --> 00:36:05,760
they don't plan to detour through the north pass,

967
00:36:05,760 --> 00:36:07,000
but to attack the summit directly.

968
00:36:07,200 --> 00:36:07,720
How about

969
00:36:08,400 --> 00:36:09,280
we flank them

970
00:36:09,560 --> 00:36:10,360
and give them an assist?

971
00:36:10,360 --> 00:36:11,240
Cut the crap.

972
00:36:11,480 --> 00:36:12,640
The Company Commander gave a strict order

973
00:36:12,800 --> 00:36:13,600
to withdraw from the summit.

974
00:36:13,600 --> 00:36:14,200
Yes, sir.

975
00:36:24,440 --> 00:36:25,520
In modern warfare,

976
00:36:26,480 --> 00:36:28,520
taking a hill doesn't mean you can hold it.

977
00:36:29,400 --> 00:36:30,560
This new ammunition

978
00:36:31,120 --> 00:36:32,520
doesn't play by the rules.

979
00:36:39,440 --> 00:36:40,240
Good.

980
00:36:41,000 --> 00:36:41,840
Great hit.

981
00:36:45,120 --> 00:36:46,640
Now their team on the peak

982
00:36:46,640 --> 00:36:47,800
is completely wiped out.

983
00:36:48,160 --> 00:36:49,040
Take the peak!

984
00:36:49,440 --> 00:36:50,280
Just now,

985
00:36:50,480 --> 00:36:52,440
the Blue Force deliberately gave up the high ground.

986
00:36:52,800 --> 00:36:54,200
Their goal was to use

987
00:36:54,360 --> 00:36:55,480
this new ammunition

988
00:36:55,680 --> 00:36:57,080
to clear the Red Force off the peak,

989
00:36:57,600 --> 00:36:59,440
and then capture it with ease.

990
00:37:01,760 --> 00:37:02,800
It seems

991
00:37:03,200 --> 00:37:05,480
traditional combat and new special operations

992
00:37:05,960 --> 00:37:07,280
are clearly different.

993
00:37:11,440 --> 00:37:12,920
They were only a small unit to begin with.

994
00:37:13,280 --> 00:37:14,240
This is a heavy loss.

995
00:37:16,680 --> 00:37:17,280
Patience.

996
00:37:19,200 --> 00:37:20,440
This is just the beginning.

997
00:37:23,880 --> 00:37:24,520
Li Songwei,

998
00:37:24,680 --> 00:37:25,640
the fish has taken the bait.

999
00:37:25,640 --> 00:37:26,360
Return to the peak.

1000
00:38:21,720 --> 00:38:22,720
Something's off.

1001
00:38:23,800 --> 00:38:25,120
These guys aren't dead.

1002
00:38:25,440 --> 00:38:26,480
They're pretty sneaky.

1003
00:38:28,840 --> 00:38:30,200
They must have just

1004
00:38:30,600 --> 00:38:32,000
relocated secretly.

1005
00:38:32,320 --> 00:38:33,360
Then what's their goal?

1006
00:38:33,640 --> 00:38:35,960
To lure Blue Force into exposing their firing positions,

1007
00:38:35,960 --> 00:38:37,200
and then strike them.

1008
00:38:38,240 --> 00:38:39,040
Deputy Director Deng,

1009
00:38:39,600 --> 00:38:40,080
what do you think?

1010
00:38:40,720 --> 00:38:42,040
With the battle reaching this stage,

1011
00:38:42,800 --> 00:38:43,880
it's getting interesting, isn't it?

1012
00:38:47,720 --> 00:38:49,080
It seems they got the intel early on,

1013
00:38:49,280 --> 00:38:50,520
so they beat them at their own game.

1014
00:38:51,680 --> 00:38:53,160
Lao Cui! Lao Cui!

1015
00:38:53,320 --> 00:38:54,880
Where is the Red Force command post?

1016
00:38:55,320 --> 00:38:57,120
The signals only show suspicious locations.

1017
00:38:57,200 --> 00:38:58,400
We need boots on the ground to scout

1018
00:38:58,400 --> 00:38:59,040
before we can be sure.

1019
00:39:00,560 --> 00:39:01,080
What about Bobcat?

1020
00:39:01,080 --> 00:39:01,720
Where is Bobcat?

1021
00:39:01,760 --> 00:39:02,680
Still no news from him.

1022
00:39:02,800 --> 00:39:03,440
It's highly likely

1023
00:39:03,440 --> 00:39:04,360
that he's already been taken out.

1024
00:39:05,920 --> 00:39:06,440
Captain,

1025
00:39:06,440 --> 00:39:07,200
I request to lead a team

1026
00:39:07,400 --> 00:39:08,680
to take down the Red Force command post!

1027
00:39:10,440 --> 00:39:12,520
How can a mere support team captain

1028
00:39:13,080 --> 00:39:14,400
be this capable?

1029
00:39:15,120 --> 00:39:15,720
Captain Wu,

1030
00:39:16,280 --> 00:39:16,960
what is it?

1031
00:39:17,120 --> 00:39:18,640
I suggest the command post move immediately,

1032
00:39:18,640 --> 00:39:19,080
otherwise,

1033
00:39:19,080 --> 00:39:20,400
we'll likely be locked onto very soon.

1034
00:39:22,720 --> 00:39:24,120
No more running in circles with them.

1035
00:39:24,280 --> 00:39:25,280
Relocate the command post.

1036
00:39:25,280 --> 00:39:26,280
Vice Captain, take your men

1037
00:39:26,280 --> 00:39:27,840
and take down Champion City for me.

1038
00:39:27,840 --> 00:39:28,400
Yes, sir.

1039
00:39:34,240 --> 00:39:34,800
Reporting!

1040
00:39:34,960 --> 00:39:36,200
We've successfully forced the Blue Force command

1041
00:39:36,200 --> 00:39:37,240
out of their underground bunker.

1042
00:39:37,640 --> 00:39:38,280
Beautiful.

1043
00:39:39,200 --> 00:39:40,640
Why did we have to force them out?

1044
00:39:41,200 --> 00:39:42,360
Striking directly with bunker busters

1045
00:39:42,360 --> 00:39:43,160
wouldn't that be more efficient?

1046
00:39:43,160 --> 00:39:44,080
There are two reasons.

1047
00:39:44,080 --> 00:39:44,640
First,

1048
00:39:44,640 --> 00:39:45,800
our frontline personnel weren't on site,

1049
00:39:45,800 --> 00:39:47,000
so there was no way to confirm.

1050
00:39:47,120 --> 00:39:47,600
Second...

1051
00:39:50,080 --> 00:39:51,040
As for the second reason,

1052
00:39:51,040 --> 00:39:51,800
ask Captain Guo.

1053
00:39:55,280 --> 00:39:56,800
You've trained your drones for so long,

1054
00:39:57,240 --> 00:39:58,640
they have to come in handy eventually, right?

1055
00:39:58,880 --> 00:39:59,560
Understood.

1056
00:40:00,400 --> 00:40:02,000
I'll issue the recon and tracking orders immediately.

1057
00:40:37,520 --> 00:40:38,360
It's dawn.

1058
00:40:39,000 --> 00:40:39,760
This battle

1059
00:40:40,240 --> 00:40:41,240
is becoming increasingly transparent.

1060
00:40:45,600 --> 00:40:46,720
Although we've confirmed

1061
00:40:46,720 --> 00:40:48,360
the new location of the Blue Force command post,

1062
00:40:50,160 --> 00:40:51,440
with just a handful of men,

1063
00:40:51,760 --> 00:40:52,520
what can they actually do?

1064
00:40:54,680 --> 00:40:55,440
Don't forget,

1065
00:40:56,040 --> 00:40:58,040
this is a clash of new-type combat forces.

1066
00:40:58,720 --> 00:41:00,160
Behind every single soldier,

1067
00:41:00,240 --> 00:41:01,680
is a powerful combat system

1068
00:41:01,680 --> 00:41:02,560
backing them up.

1069
00:41:03,080 --> 00:41:03,960
You're right, Sir.

1070
00:41:04,080 --> 00:41:05,440
I was too stuck in my ways,

1071
00:41:05,600 --> 00:41:07,600
unable to break free from traditional tactics.

1072
00:41:15,040 --> 00:41:16,280
Once we enter Champion City,

1073
00:41:16,480 --> 00:41:18,200
the electromagnetic jamming systems and anti-air missiles

1074
00:41:18,200 --> 00:41:19,040
must be in position immediately.

1075
00:41:19,040 --> 00:41:19,720
Yes, Sir!

1076
00:42:24,960 --> 00:42:25,480
Report.

1077
00:42:25,560 --> 00:42:27,040
The Deputy Captain sent an encrypted message.

1078
00:42:27,640 --> 00:42:28,080
Go ahead.

1079
00:42:28,600 --> 00:42:30,000
Champion City has been taken by the Red Force.

1080
00:42:30,000 --> 00:42:30,920
In about 20 minutes,

1081
00:42:30,920 --> 00:42:32,040
the Red Force command post will move in.

1082
00:42:32,120 --> 00:42:32,800
The Deputy Captain requests

1083
00:42:32,800 --> 00:42:34,120
a heavy firepower strike on Champion City.

1084
00:42:34,120 --> 00:42:35,120
Once it's completely destroyed,

1085
00:42:35,120 --> 00:42:36,280
we will retake it.

1086
00:42:37,000 --> 00:42:38,320
Willing to sacrifice himself.

1087
00:42:39,440 --> 00:42:40,240
Grant his request.

1088
00:42:40,760 --> 00:42:42,160
Notify the drone squadron

1089
00:42:42,440 --> 00:42:43,680
to launch all their missiles

1090
00:42:43,680 --> 00:42:45,760
and drop them all on Champion City.

1091
00:42:46,720 --> 00:42:47,800
This kind of tactic

1092
00:42:47,800 --> 00:42:48,680
isn't exactly by the book, is it?

1093
00:42:49,040 --> 00:42:50,440
There are no rules on the battlefield.

1094
00:42:51,040 --> 00:42:51,560
Fire!
